    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JungleBoys is a multiplayer survival game set in a jungle where only tactful survivors will emerge victorious. Create a custom game with friends and battle for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Jungle Battles</strong> \u2013 Navigate a dense jungle filled with treasure chests, strategic vantage points, and other players looking to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Collection &amp; Combat</strong> \u2013 Search for useful items to gain an edge over your opponents. Use items to revive when knocked down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Player Standing</strong> \u2013 Fight until the bitter end\u2014when only one player is standing and downed players cannot revive in time, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Lobbies</strong> \u2013 Play in local splitscreen lobbies with friends using Xbox controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community &amp; Support</strong> \u2013 Join our <strong>JungleBoys Discord Server</strong> to discuss the game, share feedback, request new features, and get support from fellow players and the development team.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JungleBoys is a multiplayer survival game set in a jungle where only tactful survivors will emerge victorious. Create a custom game with friends and battle for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Jungle Battles</strong> \u2013 Navigate a dense jungle filled with treasure chests, strategic vantage points, and other players looking to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Collection &amp; Combat</strong> \u2013 Search for useful items to gain an edge over your opponents. Use items to revive when knocked down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Player Standing</strong> \u2013 Fight until the bitter end\u2014when only one player is standing and downed players cannot revive in time, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Lobbies</strong> \u2013 Play in local splitscreen lobbies with friends using Xbox controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community &amp; Support</strong> \u2013 Join our <strong>JungleBoys Discord Server</strong> to discuss the game, share feedback, request new features, and get support from fellow players and the development team.</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the jungle to fight for your survival in this local splitscreen showdown. Heal up, collect items to use in combat, and look for other players to fight in custom lobbies with friends. Last player standing wins. Gameplay in the jungle supports Xbox controller use for up to 4 players.",
